# ---- private code: bridges and utility files stay on this machine only ----
lib/
bridge_*.py
*_bridge.py
*_bridge_*.py
*_tool.py
*_utility*.py
*utility_tool*.py
# Starter pack: to publish a specific bridge, add a line like  !axis-ui-interface/lib/some_bridge.py  below (or `git add -f <file>`), then rerun private_manifest.py.

# your own saved prompt recipes (the Prompt Recipe Vault); the built-in ones live in code
